# --- Vendored Osaurus full clone (P3.0 act substrate, owner 2026-06-21) ---
# The broad `Packages/` rule above (for SwiftPM checkouts) would otherwise swallow
# the vendored OsaurusCore SPM package. Re-include the vendor; upstream's nested
# .gitignore still governs its own generated output (results/, .build, etc.).
!LocalPackages/osaurus/Packages/
!LocalPackages/osaurus/Packages/**

# OpenCode work-engine runtime — vendored at BUILD time by build-opencode-runtime.sh (Bun + OpenCode); never committed (like js-editor dist/node_modules)
Epistemos/Resources/opencode-runtime/

# generated caches (do not commit)
.epcache/
.epistemos/
*.htmlworkspace/

# Reference-only third-party clones (never committed)
.research-clones/

# llama.cpp pinned XCFramework — fetched per-checkout by
# scripts/fetch-llama-xcframework.sh (sha256-verified), never committed
LocalPackages/EpistemosLlama/Binary/llama.xcframework/
LocalPackages/EpistemosLlama/Binary/.llama-*.sha256-ok
